The native R translation changes parameterization, vectorization and
quantile inversion. The exact extraction commit is not recorded.

Upstream density, CDF and quantile algorithms:
https://root.cern.ch/doc/master/PdfFuncMathCore_8cxx_source.html
https://root.cern.ch/doc/master/ProbFuncMathCore_8cxx_source.html
https://root.cern.ch/doc/master/QuantFuncMathCore_8cxx_source.html
License: https://root.cern.ch/about/license/

The R source package includes COPYING and COPYING.LGPL-2.1. The repository's
THIRD_PARTY.md additionally documents the Senn2013 data used by the separate
reproduction project; no Senn2013 dataset is bundled inside this R package.
